{"3346340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grill'd: The Vanishing", "steam_appid": 3346340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Grill’d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/5633a767d82a566e383a4b990f0f21c8.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/dbde2b63b665e08fd632a1de12169388.avif?t=1785164364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras_big/dbde2b63b665e08fd632a1de12169388.webp?t=1785164364 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/715eee695e0acfa8a69b6dd3bb70a858.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8a23a538ce967c957e18fba6472dd3a1.poster.avif?t=1785164364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8a23a538ce967c957e18fba6472dd3a1.webm?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8a23a538ce967c957e18fba6472dd3a1.mp4?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues, think about their relationships, <strong>and make connections</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each connection reveals new evidence, bringing you closer to the hidden truth behind the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/c711edc820ba046d6d2de9c623493ff9.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every evening at dinner time, everyone gathers in one place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You dine with others, engage in conversation, and cast suspicion on one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/11dc32710d5fe49950394f5e976318ec.poster.avif?t=1785164364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/11dc32710d5fe49950394f5e976318ec.webm?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/11dc32710d5fe49950394f5e976318ec.mp4?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully—the line between truth and lies will be revealed at this feast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/63bb40f2dcee7f809cfd58a502ac5e7f.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been granted special authority by the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this manor, where neither police nor judge exist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>only you possess the power to judge the suspects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8f88d3b72793ae9fa8847d61152dd74e.poster.avif?t=1785164364\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8f88d3b72793ae9fa8847d61152dd74e.webm?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/8f88d3b72793ae9fa8847d61152dd74e.mp4?t=1785164364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop out the hidden contradictions in their statements,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >poke at their lies until every deception is exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn away every lie until only the truth remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/f1be75ec14946b6e443d47ea50855809.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As food runs low, fear takes hold, suspicion grows—and people vanish one by one…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover every hidden secret and safely escape the manor?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Grill’d: The Vanishing] is a mystery dinner party detective game experienced through a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/5633a767d82a566e383a4b990f0f21c8.webp?t=1785164364\" width=750 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a royal investigator, you find yourself locked in the manor of a fallen noble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras/dbde2b63b665e08fd632a1de12169388.avif?t=1785164364\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346340/extras_big/dbde2b63b665e08fd632a1de12169388.webp?t=1785164364 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all exits sealed, you soon realize that something or someone vanishes every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the traces of missing things to uncover the manor's hidden truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.st